  "articleBody": "A successful home office remodel starts by matching the room, wiring, lighting, storage, sound control, and permit scope to how you actually work. Before requesting a quote, decide whether you need a focused room upgrade, structural changes, or added square footage, then compare contractors on design coordination, construction planning, communication, and their ability to address your existing home conditions.",
